<!--
  The Nexa identity: a notebook page with a folded corner.

  Deliberately generic stationery. It does not resemble Android's own icons, Google's apps, any
  manufacturer's system app, or any other developer's product — a launcher icon that imitated one of
  those would be impersonation, not privacy.
-->
